| scale | rounded_scaled_gradient | unscaled_gradient |
| ---: | ---: | ---: |
| 1 | 0.000000000 | 0.00000000 |
| 128 | 0.000001252 | 0.00000001 |
| 65536 | 0.000655174 | 0.00000001 |


Host scales: 128, 128, 256, 128.
